{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、一昨日と京都握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握のミニライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今、話したい誰かがいる」の2番で会場がザワザワしたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかしいなぁ...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中の影響力おそるべし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エセフィンランド人が何人か来ました(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、Mステで「ハルジオンが咲く頃」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初披露しましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかがでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/02/29/2063765/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんとMステのMポーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装もハルジオンが散りばめられてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/02/29/2063765/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでも一人でMポーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいは聖母ポーズ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすか顔小さすぎ。握りこぶしと同じサイズ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、大学の試験が終わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張でまた私の寿命は縮まりましたーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果はともあれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホッとしてるです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで心地よく寝れそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアウィーヴで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え～と 無理やりつなげましたがっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま乃木坂、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアウィーヴさんとお仕事させていただいてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年くらい前から極上のベッドが欲しいっと言っていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても嬉しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアウィーヴとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今自分が持っているベッドの上にさらに1枚ひくマットレスのこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体が沈まず、寝返りもラクっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私は今敷き布団なのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを機にベッド本体も両親におねだり中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1/22の誕プレとして待ち望んでいるのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/02/29/2063765/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまも毎日お疲れだと思うので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ快眠のためにお試しあれ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーーあと何か書きたいことあったような..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また思い出したらかくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/02/29/2063765/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}